## `abstract_generator`

``` hol4
Refute.abstract_generator :
  {ty : hol_type, constructors : term list, pred : term option} -> unit
```

Registers constructor-shaped values for counterexample discovery.  This is an
incomplete generator registration: it can find examples but cannot establish
exhaustive `NoCounterexample` results.

### See also

[`Refute.register_generator`](#Refute.register_generator),
[`Refute.register_generator_family`](#Refute.register_generator_family)
